Build fix, not interop-specific: at b09c922 three migrations share version 218
(#4546, #4549, #4553 merged in parallel), so migrating a fresh database fails
with: duplicate key value violates unique constraint "_sqlx_migrations_pkey".
Renumber two of them to 219 and 220 (they touch unrelated tables).

diff --git a/crates/server/migrations/218_poppy_personal_agent.sql b/crates/server/migrations/219_poppy_personal_agent.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from crates/server/migrations/218_poppy_personal_agent.sql
rename to crates/server/migrations/219_poppy_personal_agent.sql
diff --git a/crates/server/migrations/218_session_database_generation.sql b/crates/server/migrations/220_session_database_generation.sql
similarity index 100%
rename from crates/server/migrations/218_session_database_generation.sql
rename to crates/server/migrations/220_session_database_generation.sql
